									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >GRAVHOUNDS is a 1–4 player co-op action builder. Drop into hostile planets as a pack, build and defend your base in physics-driven mayhem, and extract with everything you can carry before you become alien chow! The longer you stay, the greater the danger... and the rewards.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >  </p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/57756b6a5313e8159dac2a24074d41bd.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Intense alone, chaotic with a crew. Combine each Gravhound's strengths and improvise to beat back the swarm. Go lone wolf to expand the operation or stick with the pack and stand your ground.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/7124ada6192ef454199e5470d40ba322.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span> </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fetch!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fling objects across the battlefield to your teammates. Turn gravity against the swarm and send them flying, one by one.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Disclaimer: Transporting volatile materials with the Grav Beam may result in unforeseen loss of Gravhounds.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/da990cfae570221a451d01475fc26a5d.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Deploy turrets, generators, and fabricators to expand the operation and defend it from the swarm.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Extend pipelines across hostile terrain to power your base, move resources, and keep your escape route alive.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/bdfd7245fdbad0997d0aba6e1247fe79.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Choose from a crew of bio-engineered canine workers built for dangerous planetary operations.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Loyal.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Obedient.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Expendable.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/dc18a33eef7f4fbe1c9f2ac502bdbb29.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=960 height=540 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock powerful new abilities and upgrades mid-shift. Stack bonuses and reshape your loadout to suit the situation. The swarm grows deadlier by the second - but so do you.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/5b1fe41d3de3932509cf8e9f62e06945.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Boost in any direction and reposition under fire. Race to your teammates' aid or make a last dash for materials.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Warning: Unauthorized recreational use of pipeline boost is strictly prohibited.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/a1dd2922565c9625f3b71bd5ac403f84.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.poster.avif?t=1792425956" width=1170 height=488 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.webm?t=1792425956" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.mp4?t=1792425956" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Seek out treacherous planets for the best materials - the higher the risk, the greater the rewards.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock new Gravhounds, weapons, and upgrade paths.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Stay longer, push harder, and the swarm escalates. Every shift becomes a bet on how much your pack can handle.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/830f3f8e04099b85a275e9f81484331a.webp?t=1792425956" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Far from home.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Swarm closing in.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Still expected to hit quota.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Get to work.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
